  "description": "The proposal comprises the conversion of the 27 flats (Class C3) to 27 serviced apartments (Class C1). Guests would not be permitted to stay for a period exceeding 90-days (inclusive).\n\nIn addition, the proposal includes the construction of a number of elements that have previously been granted planning permission by the Council, namely:\n\nThe construction of fifth floor mansard which was granted planning permission in 2014 (LPA ref: PP/2014/2754). However, instead of providing one self-contained flat, communal storage and additional accommodation to Flat 19 on the floor below, the fifth floor would provide three additional serviced apartments and a laundry room; and\n\nThe construction of an entrance hall with reception, lift, cycle and refuse store, and installation of roof lights. This element was previously granted permission in 2015 under application LPA ref: PP/2015/5473.",
